{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you are a vampire with an endless hunger. Every night, you must descend upon the village and collect as many chess pieces as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582910/extras/steamGif.gif?t=1742320021\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turn, move across the board to collect chess pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your cards to plan the perfect path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the same type of chess pieces to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you don\u2019t collect enough points by dawn, your immortal life will come to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you survive the night, you can enhance your deck with new cards or upgrades.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to learn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">53 unique cards in this demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random upgrades for endless variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And\u2026 maybe more surprises!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT THE DEMO:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are fewer upgrades available to improve your cards in this demo version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It contains far fewer cards compared to the full version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are fewer bosses compared to the full version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo does not include the challenge mode that makes the game harder each time you win.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please add to your wishlist, thank you!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582910?t=1742320021","back